# Registry manifest digests of the build-env images on GHCR, as pushed by .github/workflows/build-env.yml.
#
# Format: <short name>=sha256:<64 hex>, where the image is ghcr.io/sparrowwallet/build-env.<short name>.
# This file is the only place digests are recorded. external/source.task/source.docker.sh reads it for
# every `docker run`, and refuses to run while an entry it needs is still a placeholder.
#
# To fill in: run the build-env workflow, then copy the lines from its job summaries over the placeholders.
# A placeholder line tells the workflow to build that image; a pinned one is pulled and reused (build-env/task.sh).
